; final-response.ethos — the last message of a flow's turn, as a Datom object.
; Proposal by Psyche Fable, subflow of b05237, 2026-09-19. Library root now;
; it becomes the Signal of the nexus component that receives final responses.
Library
[]
[ FlowId.String                                  ; who: the flow this response belongs to
  Kind.[ MainFlow Subflow ]                       ; marked as what it is
  Markdown.String                                 ; the report: structured Markdown, flowcharts in prose or Mermaid
  Topic.String                                    ; a subject the flow is concerned with
  Subflow.{ Topic Markdown }                      ; a subflow the response implies: its topic and its brief
  Question.Markdown                               ; what needs a word from above
  FinalResponse.{ FlowId Kind Markdown Vector<Topic> Vector<Subflow> Vector<Question> } ]
[]
[]
